From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Peter Meiser <peter.meiser@gmx.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 10:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ARM64: configs: rook: Leave the git state out of the kernel
 version

setlocalversion appended the kernel tree's commit, -g3e46726afcbe. The
build names the kernel after the release instead, through LOCALVERSION,
as on the Echo Shows.
---
 arch/arm64/configs/rook_defconfig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/rook_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/rook_defconfig
index 939eaa0..cee5d18 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/rook_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/rook_defconfig
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 CONFIG_CROSS_COMPILE="aarch64-linux-android-"
+# CONFIG_LOCALVERSION_AUTO is not set
 # CONFIG_FHANDLE is not set
 CONFIG_MEMCG=y
 CONFIG_MEMCG_SWAP=y
